# What the reference image adds to the vendor vLLM image: harbor, whose distribution must be
# installed for the driver to import the checkout's harbor, every package harbor needs that the
# vendor image lacks, datasets for the harness's roles, and the three packages those hold at
# another version than the vendor image does (fsspec, openai, websockets). The vendor image's
# own packages are in no lock, so every package is named at one version and nothing else is
# resolved. Compiled into reference.txt by
#   hls images lock-pip layer reference --task agentic_coding --server --no-deps
